{"id":"5a383d3d0b123595","group":"90","path":"90/90-thm-first-incompleteness.md","title":"Gödel's First Incompleteness Theorem","display":"thm-first-incompleteness — Gödel's First Incompleteness Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-thm-first-incompleteness","aliases":["90-thm-first-incompleteness"],"display":"thm-first-incompleteness — Gödel's First Incompleteness Theorem","depends_on":["[[90-df-provable]]","[[90-df-godel-sentence]]","[[90-df-diagonal-lemma]]","[[90-df-proof-predicate]]","[[90-df-consistency-statement]]","[[90-df-1-consistency]]","[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]]","[[90-df-isigma-hierarchy]]","[[90-df-representation]]","[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-thm-first-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-thm-first-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-first-incompleteness — Gödel's First Incompleteness Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"00ee901093c12d44\" href=\"?note=00ee901093c12d44\" title=\"90-df-provable\">90-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b2b5974a0bdc4e1b\" href=\"?note=b2b5974a0bdc4e1b\" title=\"90-df-godel-sentence\">90-df-godel-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f57084ad3c1a7029\" href=\"?note=f57084ad3c1a7029\" title=\"90-df-diagonal-lemma\">90-df-diagonal-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4e89323a1592aeb9\" href=\"?note=4e89323a1592aeb9\" title=\"90-df-consistency-statement\">90-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c0383e348990de99\" href=\"?note=c0383e348990de99\" title=\"90-df-1-consistency\">90-df-1-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b7d7a03ff76428de\" href=\"?note=b7d7a03ff76428de\" title=\"90-df-robinson-arithmetic\">90-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"002c574215686062\" href=\"?note=002c574215686062\" title=\"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory\">90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c61fe71286984490\" href=\"?note=c61fe71286984490\" title=\"90-df-isigma-hierarchy\">90-df-isigma-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"635265d0fe56f718\" href=\"?note=635265d0fe56f718\" title=\"90-df-representation\">90-df-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,g,T\">\\(S,g,T\\)</span> 是同一有效算术编码环境，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(G\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GodelSent}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{GodelSent}_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b2b5974a0bdc4e1b\" href=\"?note=b2b5974a0bdc4e1b\" title=\"90-df-godel-sentence\">90-df-godel-sentence</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_T\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 算术公式，逐数表示真实证明码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T=\\exists u\\mathrm{Prf}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T=\\exists u\\mathrm{Prf}_T\\)</span> 也属 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}\">\\(1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}\\)</span> 保留 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"c0383e348990de99\" href=\"?note=c0383e348990de99\" title=\"90-df-1-consistency\">90-df-1-consistency</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>-可靠性定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx}\">\\(\\mathrm{REAx}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"002c574215686062\" href=\"?note=002c574215686062\" title=\"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory\">90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{meta}\">\\(\\mathrm{meta}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\\land \\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\\land\\mathrm{GodelSent}_T(G)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\Longrightarrow\n\\Bigl[(\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\to T\\nvdash G)\n\\land(1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\to T\\nvdash\\neg G)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\\land \\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\\land\\mathrm{GodelSent}_T(G)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\Longrightarrow\n\\Bigl[(\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\to T\\nvdash G)\n\\land(1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\to T\\nvdash\\neg G)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>若一致而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash G\">\\(T\\vdash G\\)</span>，真实证明码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\vdash\\mathrm{Prf}_T(\\bar p,\\overline{g(G)})\">\\(Q\\vdash\\mathrm{Prf}_T(\\bar p,\\overline{g(G)})\\)</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(G)})\">\\(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(G)})\\)</span>。Gödel 等价又给出其否定，矛盾。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(T)\">\\(1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\)</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=1\">\\(0=1\\)</span> 为假 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 句子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 一致，第一部分给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\nvdash G\">\\(T\\nvdash G\\)</span>。若还 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\neg G\">\\(T\\vdash\\neg G\\)</span>，经典逻辑和固定点等价给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(G)})\">\\(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(G)})\\)</span>。这是一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 算术句子，由 1-一致性在标准模型中为真，故存在真实的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 证明码，矛盾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留“一致性排除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>，1-一致性排除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg G\">\\(\\neg G\\)</span>”的原陈述，不把该 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 偷换为 Rosser 句子。括号明确两项结论的共同前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"00ee901093c12d44","ancho